[{"i":"11243","no":1,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">流程图图例如下，与该图例功能对应的选项是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-29-46/8489858385469202432.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">开始</font><font face=\"Calibri\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">结束</font></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">输入</font><font face=\"Calibri\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">输出</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>判断</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>处理</span></p>"}],"a":"A","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":["程序流程图的绘制"]},{"i":"11244","no":2,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">Arduino UNO/Nano</font><font face=\"宋体\">主控板，在</font><font face=\"Calibri\">Mixly</font><font face=\"宋体\">程序中使用变量保存电位器模块的返回值，下列选项中，该变量的数据类型最适合的是？（ ）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>整数型</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>小数（浮点）型</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>字节型</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>布尔型</span></p>"}],"a":"A","an":"<p>分析电位器模块在Arduino平台下的数据读取机制。该模块通过模拟输入引脚返回电压对应的数字值，其数值范围由模数转换的分辨率决定。Arduino UNO/Nano的ADC为10位，输出范围为0到1023之间的离散整数。该值表示连续的模拟电压等级，但转换结果以整数形式存储。变量类型需能容纳此范围内的所有可能取值，并匹配数据的实际表现形式。数据在程序中不涉及小数运算或布尔逻辑，也不局限于单字节范围。类型选择依据是数值的量程与数据格式特征。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["图形化编程软件的使用","图形化环境下，程序设计的三种基本结构、变量的定义及使用","模拟量、数字量、I/O口输入输出等概念"]},{"i":"11245","no":3,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列选项中，属于导体的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>橡皮擦</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>干燥的木棒</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>蒸馏水</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">220</font><font face=\"宋体\">Ω电阻</font></span></p>"}],"a":"D","an":"<p>分析物质是否允许电荷在其内部自由移动。具备自由移动电荷能力的物质可在电场作用下形成电流。此类物质的微观结构中含有可脱离原子束缚的带电粒子。当外部电压施加时，这些带电粒子发生定向迁移。电阻元件本身由导电材料构成，其功能实现依赖于电流通过。衡量标准基于材料内部载流子浓度与迁移率。绝缘体中电子被原子核 tightly bound，难以参与导电。纯净水因离子含量极低而呈现弱导电性，但普通环境中的水因含杂质而导电性增强。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["电流、电压、电阻、欧姆定律、导体、半导体等概念"]},{"i":"11246","no":4,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">程序如下图所示，该程序结构对应是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-29-46/8489858385565671424.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>顺序结构</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>选择结构</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>循环结构</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>单分支结构</span></p>"}],"a":"A","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":["图形化环境下，程序设计的三种基本结构、变量的定义及使用"]},{"i":"11247","no":5,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列选项中，用于表示电流单位的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">A</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">V</font></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Ω</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">U</font></span></p>"}],"a":"A","an":"<p>电流是描述单位时间内通过导体横截面电荷量的物理量。国际单位制中，该物理量的计量单位以科学家安培的名字命名，其符号由该名称的首字母构成。该单位符号属于基本单位符号体系，用于表示电路分析和测量中的相应数值。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["电流、电压、电阻、欧姆定律、导体、半导体等概念"]},{"i":"11248","no":6,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">一般情况下，下图程序模块对应的器件类别是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-29-46/8489858385607614464.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>传感器</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>感受器</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>执行器</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>控制器</span></p>"}],"a":"C","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":["控制系统的基本工作流程","模拟量、数字量、I/O口输入输出等概念","通过图形化编程、利用不同传感器、执行器，实现简单的交互装置"]},{"i":"11249","no":7,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">程序如下图所示，该程序中循环体被执行的次数是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-29-46/8489858385687306240.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">次</font></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\">次</font></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">5</font><font face=\"宋体\">次</font></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">9</font><font face=\"宋体\">次</font></span></p>"}],"a":"C","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":["图形化环境下，程序设计的三种基本结构、变量的定义及使用","程序流程图的绘制"]},{"i":"11250","no":8,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">Arduino UNO/Nano</font><font face=\"宋体\">主控板，通过超声波传感器控制板载</font><font face=\"Calibri\">LED</font><font face=\"宋体\">灯，程序模块如下，当超声波传感器返回的距离为</font><font face=\"Calibri\">10cm</font><font face=\"宋体\">时，下列说法正确的是？（ ）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-29-46/8489858385821523968.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">板载</font><font face=\"Calibri\">LED</font><font face=\"宋体\">灯点亮</font></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">板载</font><font face=\"Calibri\">LED</font><font face=\"宋体\">灯熄灭</font></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">板载</font><font face=\"Calibri\">LED</font><font face=\"宋体\">灯闪烁</font></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">板载</font><font face=\"Calibri\">LED</font><font face=\"宋体\">灯先点亮，然后保持熄灭</font></span></p>"}],"a":"B","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":["通过图形化编程，使用超声波传感器、舵机以及红外遥控器","图形化编程软件的使用","控制系统的基本工作流程"]},{"i":"11251","no":9,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">Arduino UNO/Nano</font><font face=\"宋体\">主控板，下图程序运行时，板载</font><font face=\"Calibri\">LED</font><font face=\"宋体\">灯闪烁</font><font face=\"Calibri\">5</font><font face=\"宋体\">次，变量</font><font face=\"Calibri\">i</font><font face=\"宋体\">的值是？（ ）</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-29-46/8489858385796358144.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">3</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">10</font></span></p>"}],"a":"B","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":["图形化编程软件的使用","图形化环境下，程序设计的三种基本结构、变量的定义及使用","程序流程图的绘制"]},{"i":"11252","no":10,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">超声波测距模块如下，下列选项中说法错误的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-29-46/8489858385901215744.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p cl